  - m_Id: 21319635969237006
    m_Localized: "Welcome!\\n\\nEvery 10 seconds waves of enemies arrive: melee,
      mid-range and ranged.\\nEvery 5 minutes a boss appears \u2014 defeat it for
      an enhanced reward.\\nEnemies grow stronger over time. The goal is to survive
      as long as possible!"
